Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: statement_list

    2 statement_list: statement
    3               | statement_list statement

    4 statement: declaration_stmt
    5          | assignment_stmt
    6          | expression SEMICOLON
    7          | if_stmt
    8          | while_stmt
    9          | for_stmt
   10          | switch_stmt
   11          | function_decl
   12          | do_while_stmt
   13          | return_stmt

   14 declaration_stmt: type IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   15                 | CONST type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
   16                 | type IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
   17                 | BOOL_TYPE IDENTIFIER SEMICOLON
   18                 | BOOL_TYPE IDENTIFIER ASSIGN bool_expression SEMICOLON

   19 bool_expression: TRUE_COND
   20                | FALSE_COND
   21                | LPAREN condition RPAREN

   22 type: INT
   23     | FLOAT_TYPE
   24     | STRING_TYPE
   25     | CHAR_TYPE

   26 assignment_stmt: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON

   27 assign: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression

   28 expression: expression PLUS T
   29           | expression MINUS T
   30           | T

   31 T: T MULTIPLY F
   32  | T DIVIDE F
   33  | T MODULO F
   34  | F

   35 F: LPAREN condition RPAREN
   36  | MINUS F
   37  | IDENTIFIER
   38  | IDENTIFIER LPAREN argument_list RPAREN
   39  | IDENTIFIER LPAREN RPAREN
   40  | FLOAT
   41  | NUMBER
   42  | TRUE_COND
   43  | FALSE_COND

   44 condition: expression EQUAL expression
   45          | expression NOT_EQUAL expression
   46          | expression LESS_THAN expression
   47          | expression GREATER_THAN expression
   48          | expression LESS_EQUAL expression
   49          | expression GREATER_EQUAL expression
   50          | expression AND expression
   51          | expression OR expression
   52          | NOT expression
   53          | expression

   54 if_stmt: IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   55        | IF LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE ELSE LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   56 while_stmt: WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   57 for_stmt: FOR LPAREN declaration_stmt condition SEMICOLON assign RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   58 switch_stmt: SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list RBRACE
   59            | SWITCH LPAREN IDENTIFIER RPAREN LBRACE case_list default_case RBRACE

   60 case_list: case_stmt
   61          | case_list case_stmt

   62 case_stmt: CASE expression COLON statement_list
   63          | CASE expression COLON statement_list BREAK SEMICOLON

   64 default_case: DEFAULT COLON statement_list
   65             | DEFAULT COLON statement_list BREAK SEMICOLON

   66 function_decl: type IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameter_list RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   67              | type IDENTIFIER LPAREN RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE
   68              | VOID_TYPE IDENTIFIER LPAREN parameter_list RPAREN LBRACE statement_list RBRACE

   69 parameter_list: parameter
   70               | parameter_list COMMA parameter

   71 parameter: type IDENTIFIER

   72 return_stmt: RETURN expression SEMICOLON
   73            | RETURN SEMICOLON

   74 do_while_stmt: DO LBRACE statement_list RBRACE WHILE LPAREN condition RPAREN SEMICOLON

   75 argument_list: expression
   76              | argument_list COMMA expression


